WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,709
I heard that there is a small official’s house in the south of the city

2
00:00:02,709 --> 00:00:04,380
In order to climb a high-definition

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,678
Any deceitful means will be used

4
00:00:06,678 --> 00:00:09,184
I don't even care about the proper rules and propriety.

5
00:00:09,184 --> 00:00:10,020
Really abominable

6
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,720
What nonsense are you talking about? You dare to say nonsense even if you heard it from nowhere.

7
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,150
Apologize.

8
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:19,280
I didn’t mention her by name, so why should I apologize to her in public?

9
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:23,680
Oh, to continue, don't be as knowledgeable as her, children are not sensible.

10
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:30,870
I am ignorant, a 16-year-old person, I don’t know how to think before I speak, so today I am taking pictures in the cold sand at my dining table.

11
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:38,390
If I go out tomorrow, will I still talk nonsense like this and be thrown into the face of Pingninghou Mansion?

12
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:39,589
Second aunt is right

13
00:00:39,589 --> 00:00:41,747
The family should not be harmed

14
00:00:41,747 --> 00:00:45,583
But Sister Ayuan used all the methods she just said.

15
00:00:45,583 --> 00:00:47,022
I'm a little curious

16
00:00:47,022 --> 00:00:48,940
Which house is she talking about?
